<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7689" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναυδ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speechless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.456
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.378
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				797
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>silent,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἄγγελος,</span> of dust, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				82
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.:—properly, <i>unable to
			articulate,</i> whereas <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφωνος</span> is
				<i>voiceless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́,</span> but of fishes, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				577
			</span></i>; <i>without speaking,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1274
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1404
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				74
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					1.90
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				16.11.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>preventing speech, silencing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλινῶν ἄ. μένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					238
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unspeakable, horrible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					947
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
